OL,5,G0232FTech Life
OL,6,     GWhen we fly we love to take our
OL,7,     Ggadgets with us. But the lithium
OL,8,     Gbatteries that power them can
OL,9,     Gcatch fire. We find out about a
OL,10,     Gnew campaign urging us to pack
OL,11,     Gwith safety in mind.
